      "description_en": "- The expiration time of the URL for the embedded page, in seconds. The value can range from 0 to 2,592,000 seconds (30 days). The default value is 86,400 seconds (one day).",
      "description_zh": "- 过期时间（秒），即内嵌页面URL链接过期时间，默认86400秒（一天），取值0~2592000秒（30天）。",
      "example": "86400",
      "help_en": "- The expiration time of the URL for the embedded page, in seconds. The value can range from 0 to 2,592,000 seconds (30 days). The default value is 86,400 seconds (one day)",
      "help_zh": "- 过期时间（秒），即内嵌页面URL链接过期时间，默认86400秒（一天），取值0~2592000秒（30天）",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "expiration_time",
      "options": [
        "--expiration-time"
      ],
      "raw_name": "expirationTime",
      "required": false,
      "type": "int"
    },
    {
      "description_en": "- The expiration time of the access token, in seconds. This is the period during which a user can access the page APIs. The value can range from 0 to 86,400 seconds (one day). The default value is 86,400 seconds (one day).\n\n- The effective expiration time of the access token is the minimum value of accessTokenExpirationTime and expirationTime.\n\n- If you call the operation using a Security Token Service (STS) token, the effective expiration time of the access token is the minimum value of accessTokenExpirationTime, expirationTime, and the expiration time of the STS token.",
      "description_zh": "- 访问令牌过期时间（秒），即用户可以访问页面接口的过期时间，默认86400秒（一天），取值0~86400秒（一天）。\n- 访问令牌过期时间是accessTokenExpirationTime、expirationTime的最小值。\n- 若通过STS调用，访问令牌过期时间（即用户可以访问页面接口的时间）是accessTokenExpirationTime、expirationTime、STS过期时间的最小值。",
      "example": "600",
      "help_en": "- The expiration time of the access token, in seconds. This is the period during which a user can access the page APIs. The value can range from 0 to 86,400 seconds (one day). The default value is 86,400 seconds (one day).\n\n- The effective expiration time of the access token is the minimum value of accessTokenExpirationTime and expirationTime.\n\n- If you call the operation using a Security Token Service (STS) token, the effective expiration time of the access token is the minimum value of accessTokenExpirationTime, expirationTime, and the expiration time of the STS token",
      "help_zh": "- 访问令牌过期时间（秒），即用户可以访问页面接口的过期时间，默认86400秒（一天），取值0~86400秒（一天）。\n- 访问令牌过期时间是accessTokenExpirationTime、expirationTime的最小值。\n- 若通过STS调用，访问令牌过期时间（即用户可以访问页面接口的时间）是accessTokenExpirationTime、expirationTime、STS过期时间的最小值",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "access_token_expiration_time",
      "options": [
        "--access-token-expiration-time"
      ],
      "raw_name": "accessTokenExpirationTime",
      "required": false,
      "type": "int"
    }
  ],
